%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doctor
    participant PC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PS as PrescriptionsService
    participant PR as PrismaService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over D,DB: CREATE PRESCRIPTION FLOW

    D->>PC: POST /prescriptions {patientId, items: [{name, dosage, quantity, instructions}], notes}
    PC->>PS: create(dto, doctorId from JWT)
    PS->>PR: user.findFirst({where: {id: patientId, role: PATIENT}})
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "User" WHERE id=? AND role=PATIENT
    DB-->>PR: User | null
    PR-->>PS: User
    alt Patient not found
        PS-->>D: 404 Paciente no encontrado
    end
    PS->>PR: prescription.create with items: { create: [...] }
    PR->>DB: INSERT INTO "Prescription" + INSERT INTO "PrescriptionItem"
    DB-->>PR: Prescription + PrescriptionItems
    PR-->>PS: Prescription
    PS-->>D: Prescription 201

    Note over D,DB: LIST PATIENT PRESCRIPTIONS

    participant Pt as Patient
    participant PtC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PtS as PrescriptionsService

    Pt->>PtC: GET /prescriptions?page&limit&status JWT role=PATIENT
    PtC->>PtS: findAll pagination currentUser
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findMany({ where: { patientId: currentUser.id }, include: { items: true } })
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "Prescription" WHERE patientId=? LIMIT ? OFFSET ?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription list
    PR-->>PtS: Prescription list with items
    PtS-->>PtC: data and meta pagination
    PtC-->>Pt: {data: [...], meta: {...}}

    Note over D,DB: CONSUME PRESCRIPTION FLOW

    Pt->>PtC: PATCH /prescriptions/:id/consume
    PtC->>PtS: consume prescriptionId currentUser.id
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findFirst({ where: { id: prescriptionId, patientId: currentUser.id } })
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "Prescription" WHERE id=? AND patientId=?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription | null
    alt Not found or not owner
        PtS-->>Pt: 403 No tenes acceso a esta prescripcion
    end
    alt Already consumed
        PtS-->>Pt: 400 Ya esta marcada como consumida
    end
    PtS->>PR: prescription.update({ where: { id: prescriptionId }, data: { status: CONSUMED } })
    PR->>DB: UPDATE "Prescription" SET status=CONSUMED
    PtS-->>Pt: Prescription updated 200